
This directory contains the executables for miscellaneous 
utility programs. All scripts can be found in the scripts directory.

PROPCMP    see the xLRCMP script
PROPAA     see the xLRAA  script
csmol      see the xCSMOL script
csinfo     see the xCSINFO script
qpcona     see the xQPCON script
analsv     analyze solute or solvent geometries in sav files
bar        see boss/README
densvol    read the file
sumdelg    see boss/testjobs/FEPaq/00README
nearres    is used to truncate a pdb file around a central residue
typeQLJ    generates OPLS/CM1A parameters for an input pdb file

